{"id":"n55521-1-7","stage":2,"title":"메달 · 奖牌","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55521-1-7-1","ko":"김 선수, 이번 수영 경기에서 메달 획득에 자신 있으시지요?","zh":"金选手，您对这次游泳比赛能获得奖牌很有信心吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김","meaning":"金（姓氏）","explanation":"김：金（姓氏）","readings":[{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"선수,","meaning":"选手，运动员","explanation":"선수：选手，运动员","readings":[{"term":"선수","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62050","senseId":"1","lemma":"선수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선수","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3"}},{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"수영","meaning":"游泳","explanation":"수영：游泳","readings":[{"term":"수영","audio":"/audio/a2fcc3f1c53a37caae9b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64611","senseId":"1","lemma":"수영","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수영","audio":"/audio/a2fcc3f1c53a37caae9b.mp3"}},{"text":"경기에서","meaning":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","explanation":"경기：竞技，比赛，竞赛；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60094","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경기에서","audio":"/audio/5be3049a0b217f8821b8.mp3"}},{"text":"메달","meaning":"奖牌","explanation":"메달：奖牌","readings":[{"term":"메달","audio":"/audio/17780d25c1715adecdba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55521","senseId":"1","lemma":"메달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"메달","audio":"/audio/17780d25c1715adecdba.mp3"}},{"text":"획득에","meaning":"获得，取得，获